# Keep .replit file (it's clean and useful)
# .replit
# ── Bram workspace state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Added 2026-09-02, bringing this repo in line with the other Bram-governed
# repos, which already ignore these and track none of them. resources/ is
# Bram's runtime workspace — port files that churn on every launch, worklist
# drafts and history — not part of the project. Setup rewrites
# .claude/bram-conventions.md and AGENTS.md on every upgrade, so tracking them
# guarantees a dirty tree forever.
#
# CLAUDE.md is the deliberate exception: it carries the project-authored
# Planner/Coder convention below Bram's marker block, and that should survive
# a fresh clone.
resources/
.claude/
AGENTS.md
